{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "diagram_type": "workflow",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Engineering Skills 工作流",
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "quality_profile": "showcase",
    "views": [
      {
        "id": "requirement-path",
        "label": "需求收敛",
        "focus": [
          "start",
          "spec_check",
          "scope_check",
          "grilling",
          "wayfinding",
          "to_spec",
          "spec"
        ],
        "note": "先核对已确认契约，并分别判断不确定性、影响范围和验证难度，需求未定时使用 grilling，关键技术路径需跨会话调查时使用 wayfinding。"
      },
      {
        "id": "design-path",
        "label": "概要设计",
        "focus": [
          "scope_check",
          "spec",
          "contract_check",
          "to_spec",
          "high_level_design",
          "execution_check"
        ],
        "note": "单一范围也可能需要 HLD，共享设计检查独立于执行图判断，需要 HLD 而缺少 SPEC 时先由 to-spec 固化已确认需求。"
      },
      {
        "id": "delivery-path",
        "label": "执行交付",
        "focus": [
          "execution_check",
          "quick_implement",
          "to_tickets",
          "loop",
          "delivery"
        ],
        "note": "单一范围且无图时使用 quick-implement，已有有效图继续 Loop，最终交付须有全部适用 AC 证据，以及各流程必需的简化、独立 verify 和 code-review。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "lanes": [
